               MOVE EIBCALEN TO WS-CALEN.
               SET WS-ADDR-COMMAREA TO ADDRESS OF DFHCOMMAREA.
               PERFORM CALL-ZCU0255O-001.
               PERFORM VALIDATE-REG-NUMBER-0001.
               PERFORM REFRESH-VALUE-0002.
               PERFORM FORMAT-EQUITIES-0003.
               PERFORM NORMALISE-AGENT-CODE-0004.
               PERFORM VALIDATE-HOUSE-TYPE-0005.
               PERFORM APPLY-EQUITIES-0007.
               EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
